0..70 Comment "//! A first-order model of `theory Nat` written in gandr source. For a"
71..133 Comment "//! first-order signature, Kaposi and Xie\'s first-order models"
134..226 Comment "//! [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics]"
227..301 Comment "//! are its algebras: a carrier for the sort and a function per operation."
302..379 Comment "//! Written in source, the models of `Nat` are the record type `#{nat : Type,"
380..455 Comment "//! zero : () => nat, succ : (n : nat) => nat}`, one field per component of"
456..536 Comment "//! `Model(Nat)` in the order the derivation mints them, and the syntax model, a"
537..598 Comment "//! counting model and a `Model(Nat)` module each inhabit it."
599..602 Comment "//!"
603..618 Comment "//! - see: #640"
619..720 Comment "//! - cites: [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics]"
721..724 Comment "//!"
